<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p><strong>Van Alstyne, TX</strong>, a rapidly growing community in southern Grayson County, sees its share of severe North Texas weather. As more families and businesses establish roots here, the need for reliable storm protection becomes increasingly clear. Texoma Storm Shelters is your trusted local provider, offering expert storm shelter and safe room installations designed to keep you safe when tornadoes threaten.</p><p>We understand the unique needs of Van Alstyne residents, especially with the surge in new construction homes. Our licensed and insured team adheres strictly to FEMA P-320 and ICC-500 standards, ensuring every installation offers robust protection. We provide free written estimates and clear guidance on pricing and potential rebates, making your safety investment straightforward and transparent.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Van Alstyne</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Van Alstyne Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Above-Ground Safe Rooms</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Ideal for existing homes or new construction in Van Alstyne, these steel safe rooms are installed inside garages or on concrete slabs, providing immediate protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
